    "$t": "聲"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>鄭宇宏</b></span></p><p><br /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">噪人耳ê厝角鳥仔，規群規kuah，bē輸leh討論今仔日，beh去佗tshia、beh去佗討食，吵醒iáu未精神、kiōng-beh掠狂ê我。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">隔壁烏狗逐車吠kah m̄願煞。我你leh！Tsîng昨暝就吵，透早iáu m̄放阮煞。隔壁頭家huah-hiu烏狗，「好--ah，lín爸khah停仔tsua̋n kā你摃hōo死。」手攑棍仔ná lé ná jiok。逐工演、逐工搬，mā無看著烏狗有按怎。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大嚨喉空ê三嬸婆--ā kah四姆--à，步lián行到廟後菜市仔，ná行ná講閒仔話，kā庄仔內通人知影ê祕密koh liū--一-改。放送頭ê恐怖，hōo阮ná想ná驚。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">橫直mā無才調睏--ah，水道頭tsūn開洗tn̄g，徛馬桶頭前sīm tsiânn久tsiah tsuānn馬桶tshiâng水，「huā—huā—huā」sio連suà。抽油煙機「hòng-hòng叫」，雞卵落鼎「pi-pi-po̍k-po̍k」，煎kah kiōng-beh臭火ta，「ting！」烘pháng機提醒好--ah。早頓tshuân好勢，「食早起--looh！」今仔日，本人ê第一聲。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">「緊--leh、緊--leh，teh-beh bē赴--ah，你今仔日ài……。」手提早頓，ná tsông ná咬，喙koh se̍h-se̍h唸，阮牽--ê交代ê聲是ná來ná遠……。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生活舞台無仝款聲音，囡仔tshia-tshi ê聲、翁仔某冤家ê聲、來來去去ê車聲，人生鹹酸苦tsiánn ê戲齣，透lām tī tsit塊曲盤，合奏出五彩繽紛ê聲音，lán tsit齣戲m̄-tsiah燦爛好看。&nbsp;</span></p></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg-nqytsLfczyKE6Ls6GlnjsAvxgU2M3a4wnSLRkirlqvZN9KOQSZKK-1X9lo8DgEbWtTbYvHfnSazaz82Ih55DmUF2T2qfDU2sNvasK930HAs7ccGMaxf8lmNOlI71ho3195QlKAfx0U8pcE4XwhbM8O_cITi4LQqz5n7Lpr0H8mhrVq-HkjTtsIlhRwsk/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1369%E6%9C%9F_19.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg-nqytsLfczyKE6Ls6GlnjsAvxgU2M3a4wnSLRkirlqvZN9KOQSZKK-1X9lo8DgEbWtTbYvHfnSazaz82Ih55DmUF2T2qfDU2sNvasK930HAs7ccGMaxf8lmNOlI71ho3195QlKAfx0U8pcE4XwhbM8O_cITi4LQqz5n7Lpr0H8mhrVq-HkjTtsIlhRwsk/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1369%E6%9C%9F_19.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5nvVxXNbsB16fakDS9BHZV92LSv5LpwZpFvjNgl7lHlcI0Ic2ESoJgJp45Fa0jt7T5-OfXIwMAzUdN6kepsdb2U1PnGCfE-LA9S0lP-4MWZhe89bXSuZQx3ijA8ncIFram-Q-9GJdDHHpqLXyPyTg3va1enY-2NVx4aOm7r3KmrMa0MeP2rN1uS0ByYX-/s1424/369%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5nvVxXNbsB16fakDS9BHZV92LSv5LpwZpFvjNgl7lHlcI0Ic2ESoJgJp45Fa0jt7T5-OfXIwMAzUdN6kepsdb2U1PnGCfE-LA9S0lP-4MWZhe89bXSuZQx3ijA8ncIFram-Q-9GJdDHHpqLXyPyTg3va1enY-2NVx4aOm7r3KmrMa0MeP2rN1uS0ByYX-/w450-h640/369%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\